{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":85778,"Title":"liked a post you made in Questions For Those That Di...","Message":"Hello!\n\nGoofyWeddings just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@    yes its on Itunes  it does cost $7 to download it.  However, with it you can organize by ceremony, cocktail hour and reception.   Also can transistion all the songs easier.\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78892-questions-for-those-that-did-the-ipod-hook-up\/?view=findpost&p=1888893\n","Sender":{"Id":282991,"Name":"GoofyWeddings","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282991.jpg?_r=1430881152","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1430863542,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85777,"Title":"liked a post you made in Questions For Those That Di...","Message":"Hello!\n\nGoofyWeddings just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nfor those that used Ipod system for music,  did you use your iphone, laptop, ipad or actual Ipod?    I have a Ipod touch.  I haven't used it in a while so recently updated it 6.1 but when I tried to download the Mywedding Dj app it needs to be 7 update or higher.also may sound silly, but using...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78892-questions-for-those-that-did-the-ipod-hook-up\/?view=findpost&p=1888890\n","Sender":{"Id":282991,"Name":"GoofyWeddings","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282991.jpg?_r=1430881152","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1430863538,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85380,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that rachelia160 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79147-bridesmaids-hair-questions\/?view=findpost&p=1895347\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"misbosox\" From what I understand, I don't think it's necessary to pay for your bridesmaid's hair if you give them the option to go to a salon or do it themselves.  That's what I did with my five bridesmaids -  three of them are getting their hair styled and two are doing it themselves, and the three getting their hair done are paying themselves.  This is how it was at my brother's wedding as well and everyone was totally find with it, including me - I definitely didn't want or expect my sister-in-law to pay when I knew I had the option to do it myself. I definitely think it's only necessary to pay if you make it a requirement that they have to have it styled at a salon.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":275855,"Name":"rachelia160","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275855.jpg?_r=1431444128","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1430811574,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":85309,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"misbosox,\n\nNMungarro has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Moon Palace Bride\".\n\nNMungarro said:\n======================================================================\nIts coming along, our deadline is the 11th to have all of our wedding stuff done and paid for (d\u00e9cor, music, etc) so I'm trying to stay organized and most importantly calm lol.  I just finished our welcome bags and I'm almost done with our escort seating cards and table numbers.  Are you getting the basic sound system and bringing an ipod? I have yet to start our music playlist, that's my next big project. You picked up your dress, how exciting!! My father in law was convinced the resort wouldn't be busy in June, when we looked online, he was shocked to see that they didn't have any more rooms that week! Hopefully they book soon, fingers crossed\n \nGood luck with the rest of your planning, June will be here before we know it!\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9613&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":281603,"Name":"NMungarro","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1430756295,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9613},{"Id":85232,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"misbosox,\n\nNMungarro has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"Moon Palace Bride\".\n\nNMungarro said:\n======================================================================\nHow is all the wedding planning going? Are you as anxious and nervous as I am! lol\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=9613#msg17595\n","Sender":{"Id":281603,"Name":"NMungarro","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1430737865,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9613},{"Id":84415,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"misbosox,\n\nmarinah84 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"66\" wally bag\".\n\nmarinah84 said:\n======================================================================\nAdded tracking to the paypal, but it's usps and here you go!  9114999944314876629546\n \nSays est delivery tomorrow!\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9450&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpg?_r=1429206783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1430382460,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9450},{"Id":84276,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"misbosox,\n\nmarinah84 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"66\" wally bag\".\n\nmarinah84 said:\n======================================================================\nPerfect!  I'll drop it off at the post office this afternoon after work (it closes at 5) or tomorrow.  I'll send you the tracking info!\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9450&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpg?_r=1429206783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1430309232,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9450},{"Id":84233,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"misbosox,\n\nmarinah84 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"66\" wally bag\".\n\nmarinah84 said:\n======================================================================\nI found it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9450&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpg?_r=1429206783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1430300108,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9450},{"Id":84228,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"misbosox,\n\nmarinah84 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"66\" wally bag\".\n\nmarinah84 said:\n======================================================================\nIt'll probably be easier if you send it to me via paypal - I'm on the site and don't see a request money button for some reason...it was there yesterday! (marinarhianne@gmail.com).  $105\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9450&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpg?_r=1429206783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1430299380,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9450},{"Id":84139,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"misbosox,\n\nmarinah84 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"66\" wally bag\".\n\nmarinah84 said:\n======================================================================\nNo, it's in basically perfect condition,  no tears\/all zippers work, snaps work, etc.\n\nI'll send a PayPal once I get to a computer,  and ship it out when I get your payment!   That is correct,  105 total. \n\nI flew southwest,  and it fit in the overhead just fine folded. If your airline has a closet,  even better!\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9450&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpg?_r=1429206783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1430287102,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9450},{"Id":83969,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"misbosox,\n\nmarinah84 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"66\" wally bag\".\n\nmarinah84 said:\n======================================================================\nDid you get my email with pictures?\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9450&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpg?_r=1429206783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1430236433,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9450},{"Id":82319,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"misbosox,\n\nmarinah84 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"66\" wally bag\".\n\nmarinah84 said:\n======================================================================\nYes, it is the trifold with straps.  I can email you pictures if you'd like.  Shipping would be $15.  Let me know if you want me to email you pictures!\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9450&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpg?_r=1429206783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429780120,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9450},{"Id":82057,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that nelmo mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78216-2015-2016-moon-palace-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1893968\n\n----------------------------------\nThanks @\"Wafflesmom\" for the list! Much appreciated!\nAnd thanks @\"misbosox\" for the breakdown. That's kind of what I feared was going on... I guess I can understand the one charge (even though the photographs are supposed to be a gift to us), but it seems unreasonable to charge us for multiple people based on the equipment they choose to bring to the resort. I hope you guys can have your groomsman film without the charge!\nOur coordinator is Abril and I think she hates us for asking so many questions, but we'll bring this up and let everyone know if we hear anything else useful.\nHope everyone is well! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":282385,"Name":"nelmo","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282385.jpg?_r=1426290839","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":262,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429716073,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":82052,"Title":"liked a post you made in 2015-2016 Moon Palace Brides","Message":"Hello!\n\nnelmo just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@    I was told by my onsite that if its a family member\/guest using professional equipment then you can be charged the $400 fee.   If they are using a regular video camera\/ photo camera or phone then no charge.    My worry is my grooman has a good quality camera and a tripod he was going to brin...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78216-2015-2016-moon-palace-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1893837\n","Sender":{"Id":282385,"Name":"nelmo","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282385.jpg?_r=1426290839","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":262,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429715603,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81867,"Title":"liked a post you made in 2015-2016 Moon Palace Brides","Message":"Hello!\n\nTheBHolders just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@    I was told by my onsite that if its a family member\/guest using professional equipment then you can be charged the $400 fee.   If they are using a regular video camera\/ photo camera or phone then no charge.    My worry is my grooman has a good quality camera and a tripod he was going to brin...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78216-2015-2016-moon-palace-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1893837\n","Sender":{"Id":278146,"Name":"TheBHolders","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429657251,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":81266,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that BecomingaRiggio mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79032-how-long-before-to-legally-get-married-if-doing-symbolic\/?view=findpost&p=1893637\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"misbosox\" Hi again. I am in North Dallas area, Addison to be exact. What resort at you at and when? We are picking up wedding license and hope to do the legal ceremony on may 1st at the courthouse\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":278682,"Name":"BecomingaRiggio","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278682.jpg?_r=1414954781","PhotoWidth":187,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1429476013,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79505,"Title":"liked a post you made in Questions For Those That Di...","Message":"Hello!\n\nhellosassypants just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@    yes its on Itunes  it does cost $7 to download it.  However, with it you can organize by ceremony, cocktail hour and reception.   Also can transistion all the songs easier.\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78892-questions-for-those-that-did-the-ipod-hook-up\/?view=findpost&p=1888893\n","Sender":{"Id":280004,"Name":"hellosassypants","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280004.jpg?_r=1412891058","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428879436,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":78895,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"misbosox,\n\nDianaSRZ has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Moon Palace\".\n\nDianaSRZ said:\n======================================================================\nHi! \nHow is the planning going? \nwhere are you planning to have your ceremony and reception?\n \nWe selected the Tucan Garden for cocktail hour and Tucan Terrace for the reception. Right now I'm debating about the DJ and lighting.\n \n \nWe got Margarita as the new wedding coordinator, but she is HORRIBLE answering emails!!! \n \n \n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=8885&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":266979,"Name":"DianaSRZ","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266979.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428660376,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":8885},{"Id":78597,"Title":"liked a post you made in 2015-2016 Moon Palace Brides","Message":"Hello!\n\nDianaSRZ just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@FutureMrsSam   you can do what we are.  Just ask them to set up the cocktail hour on the grassy area exactly next to the terrace.   Usually they use the grassy area across the walkway, but just ask your coordinator and they can accommodate it.  \n \n \n...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78216-2015-2016-moon-palace-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1890989\n","Sender":{"Id":266979,"Name":"DianaSRZ","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266979.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428606341,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":78032,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that JenniferH114 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79032-how-long-before-to-legally-get-married-if-doing-symbolic\/?view=findpost&p=1892276\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"misbosox\" - If you are getting married at the resort, even if symbolic, that should be sufficient for the honeymoon package. We are not bringing our marriage license; we just automatically get the honeymoon package. That would be crazy if you went through all of that with the resort and still had to show a legal marriage license!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":278395,"Name":"JenniferH114","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278395.jpg?_r=1421871115","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428478467,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":77855,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"misbosox,\n\nTammyWright has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Questions moon palace\".\n\nTammyWright said:\n======================================================================\nFor the free room nights, it is usually done when all your accounting for the travel is done...for the resort wedding credits, the wedding coordinator handles that usually by checkout.\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9212&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428422273,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9212},{"Id":76953,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Wafflesmom mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78216-2015-2016-moon-palace-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1891754\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"misbosox\" thanks for the update! I still don't understand how they're going to define what a \"professional\" camera will look like. My brother in law has a digital SLR camera and I know he'll take photos but he's not our photographer. We've hired a professional and paying the external vendor fee, are they now going to charge us twice if he takes pictures? \n\n@\"FutureMrsSam\" I missed the second part of your question. We chose to use the complimentary package as I wanted to customize and personalize the look of both our ceremony and reception. With the complimentary, you get a restaurant reservation. If a private event, it comes with standard table, white tablecloth and standard chairs. No centerpieces or decor.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1431039162","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428019251,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76725,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"misbosox,\n\nTammyWright has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Questions moon palace\".\n\nTammyWright said:\n======================================================================\nHi Michelle,\n \nGreat to hear from you.\n \nUsually if you have a contract, the price is locked in if the price goes up. Don't always trust what other brides are saying because if they booked through their timeshares, etc they may have higher rates.\n \nAlso, if a vendor is staying as a guest the vendor fee is waived.\n \nThe best thing to do is to send an email to your wedding coordinator with bullets of your concerns.  Them cc me and teresa.  we have a great relationship with Palace so if they do not respond appropriately we will escalate it up the chain.\n \n \n\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nTammy just wondering if you have heard this or know more info on this.\n\nregarding a new photography\/video outside vendor fee if they stay as a guest?\n\nWhen I had booked a year ago they had a special that it was $400 for outside vendor. Then recently they changed it back to original price of $800.\n\nwe had told my coordinator prior were only using outside photographer vendor and even after the change in price she stated because when we booked we locked it the $400. We told them for video that we weren't using a vendor but one of our guests that will be there for 4 nights was filing the wedding for us as wedding gift. She said since its a guest staying under our group we don't pay a vendor fee.\n\nNow I heard from another bride who is getting married in May that she was just told no matter what the outside vendor fee is $800. That if trying not to use outside vendor, but a guest that if the stay as a guest there is a fee \"guest with professional equipment fee applied when booking under same group contract\"\n\nFee $400\n\n\nHas anyone else heard of this?\n\nShe said she heard this from Daniella at Moon? Never heard of her.\n\n\nIf my onsite who I got lucky been working with since Last May told me $400 outside vendor and no fee if a guest. Shouldn't they have to honor it?\n-----------------------------\n\n \n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=9212&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427916774,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9212},{"Id":76523,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that IzzyDeee mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78216-2015-2016-moon-palace-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1891514\n\n----------------------------------\nFor myself getting married in Jamaica the outside vendor fee is 350$ US! As a Canadian bride that's huge since it'll be more like 400$! I have a close family friend that is coming to my wedding and to get around that \"rule\" I am saying she is my aunt [emoji4] they can't say no to that! She is there the entire week also (gave her one of our free trips!) so I'd say try that! It's what my future SIL did also when she got married in Jamaica 3 years ago [emoji4] @\"misbosox\"\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":282430,"Name":"IzzyDeee","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282430.jpg?_r=1426462827","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427831665,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76356,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Wafflesmom mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78216-2015-2016-moon-palace-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1891401\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"misbosox\" I have not heard anything about that, though my coordinator has told me that they've changed a lot of things this year. So far my wedding coordinator has honored all my old contract info, as long as it was already addressed or booked. For example, the old outside photographer vendor fee will be honored since I booked him before the change. I didn't book my DJ until this year so the new electricity fee would have applied had I gone with an outside dj vendor. \n\nIn your case, I'd say print out that email as proof that they said there are no charges for your guest to film your wedding. They should honor that!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1431039162","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427795146,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":76167,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that FutureMrsSam mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78216-2015-2016-moon-palace-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1891295\n\n----------------------------------\n------------ QUOTE ----------\n@FutureMrsSam   you can do what we are.  Just ask them to set up the cocktail hour on the grassy area exactly next to the terrace.   Usually they use the grassy area across the walkway, but just ask your coordinator and they can accommodate it.  \n \n \n@Moonpalacebride2be   -  We have less than 3 months to go!  We are getting married at Moon on June 23, 2015.  Right now just waiting for last minute guests to book.    We have right now 21 guests booked, but after the rest do we should have about 37-43 guests total.\n \nWe are getting married at the Tucan Gazebo,  cocktail hour booked for Tucan Garden and reception for Tucan Terrace.  What we are going to do is use the grassy area just to the right of Terrace for our cocktail hour.    Typically the garden area is right next to the gazebo, but you can always ask to do it right next to terrace if you want.  Just got to ask.   We figured it would be easier for the Music Vendor to have the speakers right there.   \nWe are doing the complimentary package.  \n \nVendors:  \nPSAV for Ipod system setup.\nBicoastal Images for wedding day and TTD photography    (outside vendor)\nHair & Makeup -  using resort salon.    trying to save $ so using resort credits for this\n \nAdd-ons:\nhorse carriage ride\n1 extra hour to reception\n1 extra tier to cake    (cake flavors:   chocolate on bottom layer,  strawberry on top layer)\n \nColors:\t Coral, Aqua and Gold\t\t\nFlowers:   DIY  made myself   7 bridesmaid bouquets   1 bridal bouquet.   using the free one from resort for toss.  we are going to use the bridesmaid bouquets after for centerpieces.\nD\u00e9cor:  bringing my own\n\t\t    table runners, signs, chair sashes,  starfish chair hangers, DIY menus, DIY vases, Mr&Mrs signs. I have more.\nreally need to start typing up my planning board for you all...\n-----------------------------\n\nThanks @\"misbosox\" I'll keep that in mind <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":276191,"Name":"FutureMrsSam","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427722943,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":75796,"Title":"liked a post you made in 2015-2016 Moon Palace Brides","Message":"Hello!\n\ncalgarybride2015 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@FutureMrsSam   you can do what we are.  Just ask them to set up the cocktail hour on the grassy area exactly next to the terrace.   Usually they use the grassy area across the walkway, but just ask your coordinator and they can accommodate it.  \n \n \n...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78216-2015-2016-moon-palace-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1890989\n","Sender":{"Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1427488476,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":75748,"Title":"liked a post you made in 2015-2016 Moon Palace Brides","Message":"Hello!\n\nWafflesmom just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\n@FutureMrsSam   you can do what we are.  Just ask them to set up the cocktail hour on the grassy area exactly next to the terrace.   Usually they use the grassy area across the walkway, but just ask your coordinator and they can accommodate it.  \n \n \n...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78216-2015-2016-moon-palace-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1890989\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1431039162","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427481316,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":75627,"Title":"liked a post you made in My Diy Brooch Bouquet","Message":"Hello!\n\nIzzyDeee just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nlove it!!!\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78987-my-diy-brooch-bouquet\/?view=findpost&p=1890987\n","Sender":{"Id":282430,"Name":"IzzyDeee","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282430.jpg?_r=1426462827","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427444204,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":75626,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that IzzyDeee mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78987-my-diy-brooch-bouquet\/?view=findpost&p=1890988\n\n----------------------------------\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nlove it!!!\n-----------------------------\n\n\nThank you! Just have to get a glass cover for it like the rose had in Beauty and the Beast, for at home to keep it on display [emoji4] @\"misbosox\"\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":282430,"Name":"IzzyDeee","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282430.jpg?_r=1426462827","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427444176,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"43","TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
