  'title' => 'Palace Resort Brides question on marriage certificate ',
  'postContent' => 'We are getting married in Mexico June 23.   Doing symbolic.  

We are getting our marriage license tomorrow May 28.    
We were going to get legally married June 5, but now ran into a snag and might have to wait til two days before we depart or after the wedding.  

My question is did any of you still do the symbolic wedding without the marriage certificate?  Also were any of you still able to get the honeymoon package with only marriage license?
',
  'follow' => 'False',
  'sessionId' => '21ccbec3ec596217addac209c96a47da',
)
