Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"156.33.241.9","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2672a9f67159f6818f390151fc114081","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;HI @&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283264-stephygirl\/\" title=\"\"&gt;stephygirl&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congrats and best of luck next month! I&#039;m sure everything will go well. As for as the fee, my WC told me that all private events are charged $55pp unless you earn free events. With 60+ rooms you earn one 2hour private function. Maybe they applied that to your reception. You have to have 75+ nights to get 3 hours of free events each day. Hope this helps!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Oh and I have a question for you - your wedding PO - does it include your vendors as well or do you pay them separately? What vendors did you choose? Thanks.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897358,"PostDate":1432728536,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>HI @<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283264-stephygirl\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>stephygirl<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats and best of luck next month! I'm sure everything will go well. As for as the fee, my WC told me that all private events are charged $55pp unless you earn free events. With 60+ rooms you earn one 2hour private function. Maybe they applied that to your reception. You have to have 75+ nights to get 3 hours of free events each day. Hope this helps!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Oh and I have a question for you - your wedding PO - does it include your vendors as well or do you pay them separately? What vendors did you choose? Thanks.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Amaqt03@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"98.169.122.6","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1352492505,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262240.jpg?_r=1421980656","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissAmber26","Id":262240,"Name":"MissAmber26","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"45.19.196.91","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"712c554b4a2feedea2d7a8c393da9866","RawContent":"@[member=\"stephygirl\"] welcome to the forum and congrats on your wedding being so close! My events are also on the Palenque Terrace and Sky Bar South. How much extra lighting did you rent? Since I haven&#039;t been there, I&#039;m not sure how much additional lighting is needed.\n\n\nAs far as the free events, check your contract. Mine says I get unlimited free events with 75+ room nights, but I know there was something free for 60 room nights as well. (I can look at mine tomorrow for you if that would be helpful).","Attachments":[],"Id":1897359,"PostDate":1432729844,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283264\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283264-stephygirl\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">stephygirl<\/span><\/a> welcome to the forum and congrats on your wedding being so close! My events are also on the Palenque Terrace and Sky Bar South. How much extra lighting did you rent? Since I haven't been there, I'm not sure how much additional lighting is needed.<br><br>\nAs far as the free events, check your contract. Mine says I get unlimited free events with 75+ room nights, but I know there was something free for 60 room nights as well. (I can look at mine tomorrow for you if that would be helpful).\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erikahime@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.191.153.24","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421799907,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281815.jpg?_r=1431031761","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":278,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Danielle1","Id":281815,"Name":"Danielle1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"167.219.0.140","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"950c492237e6ce8ae8d94ee14a9c53e8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the warm welcomes!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"MissAmber26\"] Okay that makes sense. &amp;nbsp;They did apply the 2hr private function to the reception. &amp;nbsp;I wish we had gotten the 75+ room nights, but quite a few of our guests choose to book through Southwest or Apple vacations when they had \"holiday specials\" rather than through our room block. &amp;nbsp;Kind of sucks because now we have to pay for not only their dinners at the reception ($55\/person), but we also now don&#039;t get the extra hour of free event! &amp;nbsp;Although, overall I&#039;m just happy and thankful they&#039;re attending our wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;As far as vendors - we ended up doing the JSAV Basic Package to play our iPod song list, and Zuniga for additional lighting. Our purchase order includes the fees for both of these vendors.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Danielle1\"] congrats on your upcoming wedding as well! &amp;nbsp;After the wedding I can definitely update you on the lighting situation and overall thoughts on the Sky Bar and Palenque Terrace. &amp;nbsp;Our ceremony is at 4pm and the cocktail hour is scheduled to be from 5 to 6pm. &amp;nbsp;I think it will still be light enough during the cocktail hour so we&#039;re not doing any additional lighting during that. &amp;nbsp;I believe the bar has its own lighting, so hopefully that will suffice.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The reception lighting is a GREAT question. &amp;nbsp;So far, we only have the Zuniga set of 4 columns with 2 string lanterns to outline the dance floor. Earlier today&amp;nbsp;I asked my WC for a list of lighting options Zuniga offers, since she has never really provided us with anything regarding lighting! &amp;nbsp;I happened to find the Zuniga column and string lantern lighting on my own by seeing someone else&#039;s photos from the Palenque Terrace. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;d also be interested in possibly purchasing some under-the-table lighting, and who knows what else based on the options we&#039;re given! &amp;nbsp;Another thing we are doing that may help with the lighting is that once it gets dark out, we&#039;re having our best man pass out glow sticks to all our guests. &amp;nbsp;We just purchased some glow stick necklaces from Amazon for that purpose.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m having my WC make updates to the purchase order as it is, so I&#039;m sure she&#039;ll be more than happy to add $$$ for the additional lighting we may get!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897362,"PostDate":1432732226,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks for the warm welcomes!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"262240\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/262240-missamber26\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MissAmber26<\/span><\/a> Okay that makes sense. \u00a0They did apply the 2hr private function to the reception. \u00a0I wish we had gotten the 75+ room nights, but quite a few of our guests choose to book through Southwest or Apple vacations when they had \"holiday specials\" rather than through our room block. \u00a0Kind of sucks because now we have to pay for not only their dinners at the reception ($55\/person), but we also now don't get the extra hour of free event! \u00a0Although, overall I'm just happy and thankful they're attending our wedding.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>As far as vendors - we ended up doing the JSAV Basic Package to play our iPod song list, and Zuniga for additional lighting. Our purchase order includes the fees for both of these vendors.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281815\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281815-danielle1\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Danielle1<\/span><\/a> congrats on your upcoming wedding as well! \u00a0After the wedding I can definitely update you on the lighting situation and overall thoughts on the Sky Bar and Palenque Terrace. \u00a0Our ceremony is at 4pm and the cocktail hour is scheduled to be from 5 to 6pm. \u00a0I think it will still be light enough during the cocktail hour so we're not doing any additional lighting during that. \u00a0I believe the bar has its own lighting, so hopefully that will suffice.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The reception lighting is a GREAT question. \u00a0So far, we only have the Zuniga set of 4 columns with 2 string lanterns to outline the dance floor. Earlier today\u00a0I asked my WC for a list of lighting options Zuniga offers, since she has never really provided us with anything regarding lighting! \u00a0I happened to find the Zuniga column and string lantern lighting on my own by seeing someone else's photos from the Palenque Terrace. \u00a0I'd also be interested in possibly purchasing some under-the-table lighting, and who knows what else based on the options we're given! \u00a0Another thing we are doing that may help with the lighting is that once it gets dark out, we're having our best man pass out glow sticks to all our guests. \u00a0We just purchased some glow stick necklaces from Amazon for that purpose.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm having my WC make updates to the purchase order as it is, so I'm sure she'll be more than happy to add $$$ for the additional lighting we may get!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79219-stephygirls-planning-thread-beach-palace-june-28-2015\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79219-stephygirls-planning-thread-beach-palace-june-28-2015\/<\/a>","Email":"srehm2@gmail.com","IpAddress":"167.219.0.140","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1432720763,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283264.jpg?_r=1432750548","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"stephygirl","Id":283264,"Name":"stephygirl","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"45.19.196.91","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b344c72f5c04e58cb7e74f58736ae8ff","RawContent":"@[member=\"stephygirl\"] thank you so much for the info! Please update us when you get back. I would love to hear how the terraces are\/what I need concerning lighting. The glow sticks are a great idea. I&#039;m going to do that too I think!","Attachments":[],"Id":1897363,"PostDate":1432732476,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283264\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283264-stephygirl\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">stephygirl<\/span><\/a> thank you so much for the info! Please update us when you get back. I would love to hear how the terraces are\/what I need concerning lighting. The glow sticks are a great idea. I'm going to do that too I think!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erikahime@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.191.153.24","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421799907,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281815.jpg?_r=1431031761","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":278,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Danielle1","Id":281815,"Name":"Danielle1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.208.150.207","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63613,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1432745299,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bc557601948128cea64fc8bc4c990ff6","RawContent":"@[member=\"stephygirl\"]\n\n\nThanks for answering my question about vendors.... This link has the catalogs with lighting options in it \n\n&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"https:\/\/www.dropbox.com\/sh\/jag567081hon1f5\/AAA5vn3WGPPcck_BvmeAzCFSa?dl=0\"&gt;https:\/\/www.dropbox.com\/sh\/jag567081hon1f5\/AAA5vn3WGPPcck_BvmeAzCFSa?dl=0&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897376,"PostDate":1432745243,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283264\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283264-stephygirl\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">stephygirl<\/span><\/a><br><br>\nThanks for answering my question about vendors.... This link has the catalogs with lighting options in it <br><br><a href='https:\/\/www.dropbox.com\/sh\/jag567081hon1f5\/AAA5vn3WGPPcck_BvmeAzCFSa?dl=0' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.dropbox....BvmeAzCFSa?dl=0<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Amaqt03@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"98.169.122.6","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1352492505,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262240.jpg?_r=1421980656","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissAmber26","Id":262240,"Name":"MissAmber26","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1875,"TotalPages":188,"CurrentPage":1870,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":1860,"LastPage":1870},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
