edName":"nsimpson","Id":223187,"Name":"nsimpson","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"798892e6e01e12f0da654ca385a8778b","RawContent":"&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/img17.imageshack.us\/img17\/3913\/beachweddingcake01.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n \n &lt;strong&gt;&lt;font color=\"Magenta\"&gt;&lt;font size=\"2\"&gt;OMG, Miss Ashly87&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;.....now THIS is FABULOUS!!! It just might be EXACTLY what I&#039;ve always wanted, but never knew existed -- it&#039;s themed, without being &amp;quot;cheesy&amp;quot;, yet still has a modern kind of flair. What makes this cake even better is that it would go with the Brown part of my Aqua and Chocolate Brown color scheme ---- IT&#039;S PERFECT!\n \n THANK YOU a million for finding, and (more importantly) sharing this photo; I can&#039;t wait to show it to my Mom, as we were just discussing yesterday evening how I haven&#039;t seen a cake for our AHR that has made me say &amp;quot;WOW&amp;quot;! \n \n Well, I just offically said WOW! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":962384,"PostDate":1260808711,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/img17.imageshack.us\/img17\/3913\/beachweddingcake01.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <strong><font color=\"Magenta\"><font size=\"2\">OMG, Miss Ashly87<\/font><\/font><\/strong>.....now THIS is FABULOUS!!! It just might be EXACTLY what I've always wanted, but never knew existed -- it's themed, without being \"cheesy\", yet still has a modern kind of flair. What makes this cake even better is that it would go with the Brown part of my Aqua and Chocolate Brown color scheme ---- IT'S PERFECT!<br \/> <br \/> THANK YOU a million for finding, and (more importantly) sharing this photo; I can't wait to show it to my Mom, as we were just discussing yesterday evening how I haven't seen a cake for our AHR that has made me say \"WOW\"! <br \/> <br \/> Well, I just offically said WOW! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"christie.parris@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1237188840,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215851.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"islandbride317","Id":215851,"Name":"islandbride317","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0260ecd47864c5de2ad986a863e6b0aa","RawContent":"Ashly87, AGREED w