body>\r\n                This cake is awesome!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>I am so lucky to be marrying my best friend ~ Kim<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dvcf.daisypath.com\/b08hm6.png\">http:\/\/dvcf.daisypath.com\/b08hm6.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"hulagirlkim@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"24.116.125.123","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1239556559,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216663.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":170,"PhotoHeight":226,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hulagirlkim","Id":216663,"Name":"hulagirlkim","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"85fb9cea52e1b9e7d7614b9b347a1658","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;GeminiLibra&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I already posted the cake I wanted but I changed my mind so here is my final decision. The bamboo will be darker and a little thicker and not as many flowers but here it is...\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i283.photobucket.com\/albums\/kk296\/geminilibra_2008\/bamboocake.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Much like the original poster GeminiLibra, I also wanted something totally different, but then when I went through this thread again, my eyes completely opened to this chic, beautiful cake! \n \n I just showed it to my FI, and he&#039;s fully on-board with doing this cake...the only difference is I want the flowers to match my bouquet, instead of the green cymbidium orchids shown here. So you know what my flowers look like, here they are so you can envision them on the cake!\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i593.photobucket.com\/albums\/tt17\/islandbride317\/PinkOrchidWeddingBouquet.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n I think it will look magnificent! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":827128,"PostDate":1251947688,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>GeminiLibra<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I already posted the cake I wanted but I changed my mind so here is my final decision. The bamboo will be darker and a little thicker and not as many flowers but here it is...<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i283.photobucket.com\/albums\/kk296\/geminilibra_2008\/bamboocake.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Much like the original poster GeminiLibra, I also wanted something totally different, but then when I went through this thread again, my eyes completely opened to this chic, beautiful cake! <br \/> <br \/> I just showed it to my FI, and he's fully on-board with doing this cake...the only difference is I want the flowers to match my bouquet, instead of the green cymbidium orchids shown here. So you know what my flowers look like, here they are so you can envision them on the cake!<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i593.photobucket.com\/albums\/tt17\/islandbride317\/PinkOrchidWeddingBouquet.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> I think it will look magnificent! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"christie.parris@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1237188840,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215851.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"islandbride317","Id":215851,"Name":"islandbride317","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":17711,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"32b2e657b611c10fa009aed85dcd9831","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Kits55&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;LOL! I swear that I&#039;m not trying to be mean but I totally loved your vision and inspiration for the cake...I was really excited to see your actual cake. You&#039;re right, they don&#039;t look anything alike and the fake green orchids aren&#039;t exactly the best I&#039;ve ever seen. &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; Did many people end up eating your cake? I think I might still give them an A effort. :)&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I really want to ask my WC to do a cake that I would actually like. I am really worried now though after seeing your cake.\n \n Has anyone had any experiences with the Moon Palace, Cancun? What were their cakes like?\n \n I would appreciate it if people could post pictures too :)","Attachments":[],"Id":827168,"PostDate":1251964394,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Kits55<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">LOL! I swear that I'm not trying to be mean but I totally loved your vision and inspiration for the cake...I was really excited to see your actual cake. You're right, they don't look anything alike and the fake green orchids aren't exactly the best I've ever seen. <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> Did many people end up eating your cake? I think I might still give them an A effort. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I really want to ask my WC to do a cake that I would actually like. I am really worried now though after seeing your cake.<br \/> <br \/> Has anyone had any experiences with the Moon Palace, Cancun? What were their cakes like?<br \/> <br \/> I would appreciate it if people could post pictures too <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/Z1a8p1.png\">http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/Z1a8p1.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"actl.1980@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1250496946,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220624.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":213,"PhotoType":"cus