{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76752,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2b2e8019c4b95047e4c14868ef8721a7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;hi Feath07,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I was told by the photographer that if I book him for a minimum three night stay then I would just have to pay for that because they would then be my guest. I am pretty sure if your guests are staying there and taking your pictures and staying there longer than three nights then they don&#039;t have to pay that fee. Check into it anyway because I am not 100% sure.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I was considering quite a few resorts actually and not only in Punta Cana. I was originally planning on getting married in Mexico but when I was getting pricing back it just seemed too high. So then I started looking in Dominican just to have more options and this resort happened to pop up in my searches and I am glad it did. I am glad and very happy with my selection and am hoping all of my guests will be too.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1846105,"PostDate":1398354823,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>hi Feath07,<\/p>\n<p>I was told by the photographer that if I book him for a minimum three night stay then I would just have to pay for that because they would then be my guest. I am pretty sure if your guests are staying there and taking your pictures and staying there longer than three nights then they don't have to pay that fee. Check into it anyway because I am not 100% sure.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was considering quite a few resorts actually and not only in Punta Cana. I was originally planning on getting married in Mexico but when I was getting pricing back it just seemed too high. So then I started looking in Dominican just to have more options and this resort happened to pop up in my searches and I am glad it did. I am glad and very happy with my selection and am hoping all of my guests will be too.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Kristy and Nathan<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Melia Caribe Tropical <\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>April 17, 2015<\/strong>","Email":"colek_64@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395321414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277264.jpg?_r=1429937323","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kcole123","Id":277264,"Name":"kcole123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"97.91.185.236","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76752,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c22218fca84e530550631a08c3c63f77","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"kcole123\"] - we have the same wedding date! (you&#039;re the first one i&#039;ve seen with the same date and it made me excited lol)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1846332,"PostDate":1398434428,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277264\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277264-kcole123\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kcole123<\/span><\/a> - we have the same wedding date! (you're the first one i've seen with the same date and it made me excited lol)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ff6666;\">I love him & he loves me, we'll be married by the sea.<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77696-our-dw-dreams-riviera-cancun-17-apr-2015\/'>Planning\u00a0Journal<\/a>\u00a0& <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/blog\/86-my-destination-wedding-blog\/'>Blog<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"tricia.d.davis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"97.91.185.236","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396255319,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277418.jpg?_r=1429976005","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pddcmc","Id":277418,"Name":"pddcmc","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76752,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"36c3ee20379bd38488bb532ce261497c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"pddcmc\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;That&#039;s so exciting. I have never noticed anyone getting married the same date either, until now. What resort are you getting married on?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1846337,"PostDate":1398434753,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277418\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277418-pddcmc\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">pddcmc<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>That's so exciting. I have never noticed anyone getting married the same date either, until now. What resort are you getting married on?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Kristy and Nathan<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Melia Caribe Tropical <\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>April 17, 2015<\/strong>","Email":"colek_64@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395321414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277264.jpg?_r=1429937323","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kcole123","Id":277264,"Name":"kcole123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"97.91.185.236","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76752,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7717930d43bb362d5a1ebf2042bbd047","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Dreams Riviera Cancun :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I see yall are going to DR... my bestie honeymooned there and LOVED it!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;What is yalls timeline as far as STDs, invites, etc??&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1846343,"PostDate":1398435419,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Dreams Riviera Cancun <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I see yall are going to DR... my bestie honeymooned there and LOVED it!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What is yalls timeline as far as STDs, invites, etc??<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ff6666;\">I love him & he loves me, we'll be married by the sea.<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77696-our-dw-dreams-riviera-cancun-17-apr-2015\/'>Planning\u00a0Journal<\/a>\u00a0& <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/blog\/86-my-destination-wedding-blog\/'>Blog<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"tricia.d.davis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"97.91.185.236","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396255319,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277418.jpg?_r=1429976005","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pddcmc","Id":277418,"Name":"pddcmc","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76752,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2a5705e3e6f1418508ec4ef2749338d5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have my invites in for printing. someone else is doing them for me. The lady doing my invites brought them to the printers on Monday and she said they usually take 7-10 days. I will have my invites out in May to everyone, which still gives people plenty of time. I didn&#039;t do STD&#039;s just the invites. I figure if I sent them out early enough then that would be fine.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1846345,"PostDate":1398435550,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I have my invites in for printing. someone else is doing them for me. The lady doing my invites brought them to the printers on Monday and she said they usually take 7-10 days. I will have my invites out in May to everyone, which still gives people plenty of time. I didn't do STD's just the invites. I figure if I sent them out early enough then that would be fine.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Kristy and Nathan<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Melia Caribe Tropical <\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>April 17, 2015<\/strong>","Email":"colek_64@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395321414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277264.jpg?_r=1429937323","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kcole123","Id":277264,"Name":"kcole123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"97.91.185.236","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76752,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f89b828b2908077276610f461d9dc2a8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Gotcha. I&#039;m going to design save the dates online and email them, and send formal invites by August.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1846353,"PostDate":1398436341,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Gotcha. I'm going to design save the dates online and email them, and send formal invites by August.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ff6666;\">I love him & he loves me, we'll be married by the sea.<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77696-our-dw-dreams-riviera-cancun-17-apr-2015\/'>Planning\u00a0Journal<\/a>\u00a0& <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/blog\/86-my-destination-wedding-blog\/'>Blog<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"tricia.d.davis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"97.91.185.236","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396255319,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277418.jpg?_r=1429976005","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pddcmc","Id":277418,"Name":"pddcmc","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76752,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9d3c8085b3a1aa46f03030c1b0e7cc41","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;That&#039;s a good idea too at least people will know they are invited and can start saving if they need to.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1846357,"PostDate":1398436757,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>That's a good idea too at least people will know they are invited and can start saving if they need to.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Kristy and Nathan<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Melia Caribe Tropical <\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>April 17, 2015<\/strong>","Email":"colek_64@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395321414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277264.jpg?_r=1429937323","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kcole123","Id":277264,"Name":"kcole123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.227.248.106","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76752,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8297733384bf1d5eac5eccbfab739f28","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Wow! $1000 is high. Grand Palladium charges $500 for outside photographer. Luckily 3 photographers are family members with my group.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1846364,"PostDate":1398437363,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Wow! $1000 is high. Grand Palladium charges $500 for outside photographer. Luckily 3 photographers are family members with my group.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mrswithclass@aol.com","IpAddress":"96.227.248.106","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1376865303,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272718.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"1BeachBride","Id":272718,"Name":"1BeachBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"130.219.8.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76752,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6a7f0934857d82660295ed1ee0805c07","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kcole123\" post=\"1846337\" timestamp=\"1398459953\"]\n@[member=\"pddcmc\"]\nThat&#039;s so exciting. I have never noticed anyone getting married the same date either, until now. What resort are you getting married on?[\/quote]\nLOL...that makes 3 of us! April 17, 2015!!! So excited! Congrats everyone! My fiance and I chose Paradisus Palma Real in DR....I fell in love with it! they too have a $1000 fee for outside vendors. But you also have the option to pay for a three night stay. However, I was looking at their home photographer and their work looks great.","Attachments":[],"Id":1846857,"PostDate":1398596734,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kcole123, on 25 April 2014 - 02:05 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277418\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277418-pddcmc\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">pddcmc<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>That's so exciting. I have never noticed anyone getting married the same date either, until now. What resort are you getting married on?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>LOL...that makes 3 of us! April 17, 2015!!! So excited! Congrats everyone!\u00a0My fiance and I\u00a0chose Paradisus Palma Real in DR....I fell in love with it! they too have a $1000 fee for outside vendors. But you also have the option to pay for a three night stay. However, I was looking at their home photographer and their work looks great.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"evelinmz@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"130.219.8.11","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1377418746,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272896.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MunecaEve","Id":272896,"Name":"MunecaEve","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"97.91.185.236","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76752,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"716659ea78511c5da90e384072efae59","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"MunecaEve\"] - Congrats to you, too! Wow, that is a crazy fee!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1846919,"PostDate":1398623498,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"272896\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/272896-munecaeve\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MunecaEve<\/span><\/a> - Congrats to you, too! Wow, that is a crazy fee!!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ff6666;\">I love him & he loves me, we'll be married by the sea.<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77696-our-dw-dreams-riviera-cancun-17-apr-2015\/'>Planning\u00a0Journal<\/a>\u00a0& <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/blog\/86-my-destination-wedding-blog\/'>Blog<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"tricia.d.davis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"97.91.185.236","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396255319,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277418.jpg?_r=1429976005","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pddcmc","Id":277418,"Name":"pddcmc","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":26,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
